METU App has been temporarily shut down because it was found to be operated without the permission of its developers. During this time, the course schedule, cafeteria menu, ring times, email, ODTÜClass notifications, the campus map and every other feature will be unavailable. Your data stays safe on your device and you will pick up where you left off once the app reopens.

Follow our GitHub page for updates and for when the app will be available again. Thank you for your understanding.
